 "role": "Splinterborn boss · Meteor Fall event · Leap Slam, Effect Pulse (heat), Call Adds",
 "hitbox_blocks": [2.5, 3.0, 2.5],
 "notes": [
  "Facing north (-Z). Origin at feet centre. 1 grid square = 1 texture pixel = 1/16 block. Hitbox 2.5 x 3 x 2.5 blocks; the long arms and back spikes reach past it.",
  "A hunched lump of blackened meteor rock whose whole torso is a mouth: black-glass teeth, glowing magma inside, and the splinter sitting deep in the maw as its core. Three small ember eyes sit above the brow.",
  "Bones (15): root > body > jaw, brow, core, spikes; body > arm_l > forearm_l > fist_l (same on the right); body > leg_l, leg_r. Paint the magma cracks and the inside of the mouth in the glow texture.",
  "Animations: spawn (cracks out of a fallen meteor), idle (maw breathes open and shut, cracks pulse), walk, run, attack (double-fist smash), hurt, death (cools to grey stone and splits; the splinter rolls out of the mouth), ability_leap_slam (leap, crater landing), ability_effect_pulse (maw opens wide, heat wave), ability_call_adds (spits out Cinder Mites)."
 ],
